OL,3,GNEWSATwo women arrested over boy's
OL,4,Awindow fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fthree-year-old boy was seriously
OL,8,Finjured in a fall from a window in
OL,9,FRochdale.
OL,11,FThe women, aged 19 and 20, were
OL,12,Farrested at a property in Blackburn on
OL,13,FSunday on suspicion of causing a
OL,14,Fserious injury to a child, Greater
OL,15,FManchester Police said.
OL,17,FOfficers had been called to Spotland
OL,18,FTops at 16:16 BST on Saturday following
OL,19,Freports of concern for the welfare of a
OL,20,Fchild.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
